# 5. P0 — Scheduler

## 5.1 Task Scheduler

* [x] Priority Queue
* [x] Task State Management
* [x] Task Dependencies — with transitive failure propagation
* [x] Task Cancellation
* [x] Cascading Cancellation
* [x] Retry
* [x] Backoff
* [x] Timeout
* [x] Graceful Shutdown
* [x] Process-wide Concurrency Quota — agent-resource: per-class semaphores, process-wide rather than per-turn

## 5.2 Task Lifecycle

```text
Created
  ↓
Queued
  ↓
Running
  ↓
Waiting
  ↓
Running
  ↓
Completed
```

Failure flow:

```text
Running
   ↓
Failed
   ↓
Retry
   ↓
Running
```

Cancellation flow:

```text
Running
   ↓
Cancelled
```

